WEBVTT

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:22.088
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:26.593
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:30.663
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.663 --> 00:00:35.268
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:43.309
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:54.083
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.487 --> 00:00:58.525
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.525 --> 00:01:02.962
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:07.033
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:14.701
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:42.129
Why don't you use your sword?

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:43.999
None of your business!

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:45.367
Fight.

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:47.270
I refuse!

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.504
You should have a reason to fight.

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:53.303
After all, I killed Joganki.

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:57.075
I couldn't care less what happened to that idiot!

00:01:58.551 --> 00:01:59.279
Liar.

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:07.457
Now...

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:08.384
Fight!

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:10.254
I told you, didn't I?

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:11.422
I refuse!

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:21.472
The Mirage of a Soul Never to Return

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:23.400
What is this?

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:25.069
This is...

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:26.435
What a...

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.404
What steadfast love.

00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:32.974
Supreme joy, abysmal loneliness...

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:36.717
I feel like my heart will burst!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:42.094
What is it to be of The Third?

00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:45.925
We have an overwhelming capacity
to process information and yet...

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:47.893
I...

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:49.963
I...

00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:53.467
You can make free use of this place.

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:56.467
You'll be able to delve into your
research to your heart's content.

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:58.068
Joganki!

00:03:00.446 --> 00:03:03.381
So, you're going to amplify
your psychic energy with this?

00:03:04.284 --> 00:03:06.184
Yes, Joganki.

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:09.580
Joganki!

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:13.382
Joganki!

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:17.226
Joganki.

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:19.620
Joganki.

00:03:26.539 --> 00:03:27.836
Joganki...

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:51.994
Hey, you okay?

00:03:57.003 --> 00:03:59.028
How can I get you down from there?

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:00.930
It's no use.

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:03.466
Even Joganki wasn't able to crack it.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:30.334
Honestly! Look at the condition you're in...

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.068
Why didn't you use your sword?

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:37.470
What about you? You shouldn't
be wasting your energy.

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:44.479
Wasting?

00:04:44.851 --> 00:04:46.716
I didn't sense any intent to kill.

00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:48.817
Or really, much of anything.

00:04:48.888 --> 00:04:53.382
If I had to say, it sort of felt
like I was just being watched.

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.828
If I drew my sword every
time someone looked at me,

00:04:55.828 --> 00:04:57.489
I'd be nothing but a common outlaw.

00:04:58.398 --> 00:04:59.865
You're strong...

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.095
Nothing like me.

00:05:02.802 --> 00:05:07.102
It was as you said.
I had no intention of harming you.

00:05:07.807 --> 00:05:10.776
I just wanted to know more about you.

00:05:11.177 --> 00:05:12.201
That was why.

00:05:12.745 --> 00:05:13.871
I'm sorry.

00:05:14.247 --> 00:05:15.509
Forget about it.

00:05:16.616 --> 00:05:18.481
Joganki is alive.

00:05:18.985 --> 00:05:19.849
Yeah.

00:05:20.853 --> 00:05:23.185
Hey, can't we detach this?

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:25.051
We need to get you treatment quickly.

00:05:25.692 --> 00:05:27.125
I'm out of time already.

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:27.952
What?

00:05:28.227 --> 00:05:30.058
I can't be cured, no matter what.

00:05:30.496 --> 00:05:32.623
This is my lifespan, you see.

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:35.600
You saw my corpse, didn't you?

00:05:36.235 --> 00:05:37.634
I am her.

00:05:37.837 --> 00:05:39.771
A facsimile of Rona Fauna.

00:05:40.173 --> 00:05:43.609
A clone made from her DNA.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:48.579
That's why I can only live as long as she did.

00:05:49.148 --> 00:05:52.379
I'm defective, so it can't be helped.

00:05:53.052 --> 00:05:55.384
Defective?

00:06:03.029 --> 00:06:03.996
Paife.

00:06:05.131 --> 00:06:06.189
Paife!

00:06:06.466 --> 00:06:09.736
Hono's fine. She's not in danger.

00:06:09.736 --> 00:06:10.998
What happened?

00:06:12.772 --> 00:06:13.739
Nothing.

00:06:14.807 --> 00:06:15.796
It's just...

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:20.643
...the sorrow was so great...

00:06:21.647 --> 00:06:26.016
Yes. I... She was a defect.

00:06:26.886 --> 00:06:28.080
What do you mean?

00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:32.285
I can read the minds of machines.

00:06:33.526 --> 00:06:36.825
That's the power that came with my astral eye.

00:06:37.463 --> 00:06:41.567
But everyone feared that
my unfamiliar ability...

00:06:41.567 --> 00:06:45.025
...would upset the balance
of the existing system.

00:06:45.705 --> 00:06:50.877
I was only thinking that if we could
mentally merge with machines,

00:06:50.877 --> 00:06:55.177
we would be able to create
a more efficient system...

00:06:55.915 --> 00:07:00.545
I was shunned, isolated, and watched.

00:07:01.187 --> 00:07:06.716
I hated The Third, cursed myself,
and gave up on everything.

00:07:07.894 --> 00:07:13.298
But that was when Joganki
offered me a helping hand.

00:07:14.367 --> 00:07:17.200
What am I saying?

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:20.364
Telling you this when I've only met you.

00:07:21.641 --> 00:07:23.165
You're a remarkable person.

00:07:23.643 --> 00:07:25.736
You make me feel at peace.

00:07:26.446 --> 00:07:27.743
Tell me more.

00:07:28.581 --> 00:07:29.741
He...

00:07:30.416 --> 00:07:34.580
Joganki allowed me to use
this place for my research.

00:07:36.088 --> 00:07:40.184
Thanks to him, I succeeded
in building this system.

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:44.197
Nanomachines created from
my own nerve cells...

00:07:44.197 --> 00:07:47.496
...that amplify my psychic energy.

00:07:49.402 --> 00:07:51.962
Joganki was extremely pleased
with what I had done.

00:07:52.939 --> 00:07:54.634
I was happy, too.

00:07:55.174 --> 00:08:00.339
That there was a job even
a defect like me could do.

00:08:00.947 --> 00:08:03.677
That I had the capacity to bring joy to someone.

00:08:05.117 --> 00:08:06.175
Rona...

00:08:06.552 --> 00:08:11.390
I think that's why Rona created me,

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:14.154
so I could continue the
research even after she died.

00:08:14.327 --> 00:08:19.465
And though I had been born of
illegal genetic technology,

00:08:19.465 --> 00:08:22.662
Joganki hid me from the Central
Integrated Government.

00:08:23.402 --> 00:08:26.098
He told me to live on here.

00:08:26.439 --> 00:08:29.931
I was so happy, I could barely stop crying.

00:08:35.481 --> 00:08:36.607
I think,

00:08:36.716 --> 00:08:39.310
the few years Rona had here...

00:08:39.485 --> 00:08:43.512
...were surely the happiest time in her life.

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:46.125
Because thanks to Joganki,

00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:49.228
she was able to feel a sense
of purpose to her existence...

00:08:49.228 --> 00:08:51.059
...during those few years...

00:09:02.074 --> 00:09:03.098
As I suspected...

00:09:03.743 --> 00:09:04.710
...you're here too.

00:09:05.111 --> 00:09:06.237
Where is Miss Honoka?

00:09:06.879 --> 00:09:08.278
If it is Honoka...

00:09:08.881 --> 00:09:11.441
If it is Honoka, I doubt we need worry.

00:09:12.184 --> 00:09:13.981
I suppose that is true.

00:09:14.453 --> 00:09:17.684
Incidentally, that woman is a clone, isn't she?

00:09:18.424 --> 00:09:19.755
You met her?

00:09:20.092 --> 00:09:21.252
Above.

00:09:21.394 --> 00:09:23.328
My companion defeated her.

00:09:23.596 --> 00:09:26.759
But she was no ordinary clone.

00:09:27.099 --> 00:09:29.863
You could tell, just by looking?

00:09:30.002 --> 00:09:32.104
That much, at least.

00:09:32.104 --> 00:09:36.131
It is true, that one was adjusted for combat.

00:09:36.475 --> 00:09:37.601
As I thought.

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:40.442
I know what you're trying to say.

00:09:40.813 --> 00:09:44.010
I was willfully neglecting her.

00:09:44.717 --> 00:09:46.708
I had been for many years.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:51.188
I am solely responsible for
bringing about this situation.

00:09:51.524 --> 00:09:52.825
Even if that's true,

00:09:52.825 --> 00:09:55.623
it'll ultimately end without anything happening.

00:09:55.928 --> 00:09:58.556
This was just one of those kinds of things.

00:09:59.832 --> 00:10:02.767
Nothing escapes you, does it?

00:10:03.436 --> 00:10:04.596
Fine.

00:10:05.104 --> 00:10:06.093
Hypothetically...

00:10:06.472 --> 00:10:09.342
Hypothetically, even if it's as you say,

00:10:09.342 --> 00:10:12.709
I cannot understand this situation.

00:10:13.179 --> 00:10:15.670
The Third do not have the ability to procreate.

00:10:16.616 --> 00:10:17.850
Strictly speaking,

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:21.377
even the concept of sexuality
does not apply to our species.

00:10:22.488 --> 00:10:25.787
I am one of The Third.

00:10:26.158 --> 00:10:30.763
Yes, I'm sure that sentiment has reached her.

00:10:30.763 --> 00:10:33.789
Just as her sentiment reached you.

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:50.341
It was all out of my own selfish desire.

00:10:51.017 --> 00:10:53.747
Because of that, I made Joganki suffer...

00:10:53.986 --> 00:10:55.977
...and dragged you into this.

00:10:56.288 --> 00:10:59.883
Oh, I feel so good.

00:11:00.559 --> 00:11:02.322
I feel so warm.

00:11:03.896 --> 00:11:06.694
So this is your power...

00:11:07.466 --> 00:11:11.197
Honoka was slowly pouring her chi into Rona.

00:11:12.471 --> 00:11:14.507
No matter how much she poured in,

00:11:14.507 --> 00:11:18.210
she knew it was spilling away just as quickly,

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:20.303
but she couldn't bring herself to stop.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:24.242
As someone who shared the same soul.

00:11:24.917 --> 00:11:29.320
As someone who stood on
that same icy snowfield.

00:11:36.562 --> 00:11:37.358
Honoka...

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:49.271
I am, too.

00:11:50.142 --> 00:11:51.734
I'm the same as you.

00:11:52.478 --> 00:11:56.847
A defect, who wasn't allowed
to join The Third's world.

00:11:58.117 --> 00:11:59.414
That's why.

00:12:00.052 --> 00:12:03.112
Why I was able to talk to you so much.

00:12:03.556 --> 00:12:04.523
I see.

00:12:05.825 --> 00:12:08.419
I had no idea someone like you was out there.

00:12:09.528 --> 00:12:11.723
You've lived all this time out
on the frontier, haven't you?

00:12:12.765 --> 00:12:13.732
Yeah.

00:12:14.533 --> 00:12:16.125
Wasn't it hard?

00:12:16.235 --> 00:12:17.536
It's hard.

00:12:17.536 --> 00:12:19.766
It's hard and it's painful.

00:12:20.539 --> 00:12:25.636
I felt I needed to prove who
I was and what I was capable of.

00:12:25.745 --> 00:12:28.981
It was always desperately on my mind.

00:12:28.981 --> 00:12:31.973
That's why I can really understand how you feel.

00:12:32.852 --> 00:12:35.685
I can understand, as if they
were my own feelings.

00:12:36.155 --> 00:12:40.251
I could have been you.

00:12:40.693 --> 00:12:43.457
But for a slightly different fate...

00:12:43.829 --> 00:12:44.693
Yeah.

00:12:47.366 --> 00:12:49.698
I wish I could have met you sooner.

00:12:50.536 --> 00:12:55.473
If I had, perhaps a different fate
would have opened up for me.

00:12:56.041 --> 00:12:58.043
It's still not too late.

00:12:58.043 --> 00:13:00.671
I'm sure Joganki would make it work somehow.

00:13:05.017 --> 00:13:06.143
Rona...

00:13:45.024 --> 00:13:45.888
Let's go.

00:14:01.073 --> 00:14:01.732
Rona...

00:14:29.768 --> 00:14:32.635
Taking over all functions as of now.

00:14:33.973 --> 00:14:36.840
Activate wormhole driver system.

00:14:36.909 --> 00:14:37.398
What?!

00:14:37.710 --> 00:14:38.699
I will destroy it!

00:14:49.121 --> 00:14:50.179
Telekinesis?!

00:14:56.729 --> 00:14:58.788
Fila Marique, respond!

00:15:00.866 --> 00:15:02.993
I can hear you. Are you all right?

00:15:03.335 --> 00:15:04.802
What of the wormhole driver?

00:15:05.237 --> 00:15:06.534
Have you retaken the system?

00:15:06.939 --> 00:15:08.133
N-No.

00:15:08.307 --> 00:15:12.478
We need a little more time to eliminate
Rona Fauna's influence.

00:15:12.478 --> 00:15:15.311
Hurry! The wormhole driver
is about to be activated!

00:15:16.448 --> 00:15:17.779
What did you just say?

00:15:18.317 --> 00:15:20.719
Destroy it immediately, satellite and all!

00:15:20.719 --> 00:15:22.243
That is impossible.

00:15:22.554 --> 00:15:25.921
We have not recovered overall control
of the attack satellites, either.

00:15:26.058 --> 00:15:28.961
Under present circumstances,
missiles fired from the surface...

00:15:28.961 --> 00:15:30.663
...will also be shot down by the laser satellites...

00:15:30.663 --> 00:15:31.823
Enough with the excuses!

00:15:33.232 --> 00:15:34.529
Joganki...

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:38.199
There's nothing we can do. How can this be?

00:15:38.804 --> 00:15:39.896
I...

00:15:40.272 --> 00:15:41.573
I was...

00:15:41.573 --> 00:15:42.699
Let's have faith.

00:15:44.677 --> 00:15:45.769
Faith?

00:15:46.178 --> 00:15:46.701
Yes.

00:15:47.479 --> 00:15:48.881
In Miss Rona.

00:15:48.881 --> 00:15:50.940
And in Miss Honoka.

00:15:53.919 --> 00:15:54.681
What is it?

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:22.669
Teacher...

00:16:23.349 --> 00:16:24.338
The chi...

00:16:25.217 --> 00:16:28.448
There's an incredible amount
of chi being focused.

00:16:28.954 --> 00:16:29.888
Chi?

00:16:29.888 --> 00:16:31.788
I'm telling you, there's chi being focused!

00:16:32.725 --> 00:16:35.558
With... With this building as its focal point.

00:16:36.295 --> 00:16:38.593
Is it... Honoka?

00:16:39.631 --> 00:16:43.624
Wormhole driver, lock on to planet core.

00:16:43.902 --> 00:16:46.496
