00:19:03.142 --> 00:19:03.836
Yes.

00:19:07.346 --> 00:19:10.144
Such is the way of The Third...

00:19:12.718 --> 00:19:15.243
STW-9000, mission complete.

00:19:15.988 --> 00:19:17.853
Await your orders in Cargo 3.

00:19:36.441 --> 00:19:37.738
I am indebted to you.

00:19:38.744 --> 00:19:40.473
My responsibility for getting
you caught up in this...

00:19:40.879 --> 00:19:44.474
You idiot. I came on a job.

00:19:44.583 --> 00:19:45.948
A. Job.

00:19:46.051 --> 00:19:47.177
Get it?

00:19:47.452 --> 00:19:50.080
Once I accept a job, the rest's my responsibility.

00:19:50.522 --> 00:19:52.624
Your responsibility is honest accounting.

00:19:52.624 --> 00:19:54.182
I'll be looking forward to your payment!

00:19:55.561 --> 00:19:56.687
Thank you.

00:19:58.330 --> 00:19:59.422
She...

00:20:00.165 --> 00:20:03.157
...met her end with a smile.

00:20:05.671 --> 00:20:06.763
Well, then.

00:20:06.972 --> 00:20:08.166
Oh, hold on a second.

00:20:08.273 --> 00:20:08.830
What?

00:20:09.341 --> 00:20:11.172
What happened to Juliet?

00:20:11.443 --> 00:20:13.707
The pilot that transported us.

00:20:14.213 --> 00:20:17.546
Pilot? Do you mean the transport
plane's artificial intelligence?

00:20:17.716 --> 00:20:19.308
Yup. Is she all right?

00:20:19.618 --> 00:20:21.920
Yes. Thanks to the self-preservation system,

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.080
it has suffered no damage.

00:20:24.056 --> 00:20:25.045
I see.

00:20:27.693 --> 00:20:29.160
She sure looks happy.

00:20:29.494 --> 00:20:30.825
She is happy.

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:35.530
Miss Honoka, Mr. Bogie and Teacher, you too.

00:20:36.201 --> 00:20:39.534
Not one of you ever thought of giving up.

00:20:40.072 --> 00:20:41.505
That is why she is happy.

00:20:42.341 --> 00:20:44.832
Those who speak of death have no future.

00:20:45.177 --> 00:20:47.713
That is probably a universal truth...

00:20:47.713 --> 00:20:50.443
...no, that is, I mean a worldly truth.

00:20:50.749 --> 00:20:54.207
I don't really care if you say universe or world.

00:20:54.586 --> 00:20:55.575
Pardon me.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:00.558
You got beat up bad.

00:21:00.659 --> 00:21:03.695
How about going on a vacation
after we receive our payment?

00:21:03.695 --> 00:21:05.322
Hey, good idea!

00:21:05.697 --> 00:21:08.598
We can't work until the
repairs are done, anyway.

00:21:09.268 --> 00:21:11.099
Oh, but before we do...

00:21:11.336 --> 00:21:12.826
Before we do, what?

00:21:14.339 --> 00:21:15.670
A journey through the sky.

00:21:21.413 --> 00:21:23.973
It isn't that he won't love anyone.

00:21:24.916 --> 00:21:26.850
Nor is it that he cannot love.

00:21:27.586 --> 00:21:32.114
It's only that there's someone
else in his heart that isn't me.

00:21:33.725 --> 00:21:35.861
So please realize that for him.

00:21:35.861 --> 00:21:39.058
Find out what his true feelings are for him.

00:21:40.098 --> 00:21:43.932
You, who shares the same soul as me.

00:21:53.011 --> 00:21:56.448
An intersection waiting for morning...
Asa o matteiru kousaten ga

00:21:56.448 --> 00:22:00.452
...cradling an abandoned cat that wandered in.
Mayoikonda sute-neko o daiteiru

00:22:00.452 --> 00:22:03.055
Red and green and yellow.
Aka to ao to kiiro

00:22:03.055 --> 00:22:06.047
It is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:06.725 --> 00:22:10.162
Stopping just after dawn,
Akegata-sugi ni furiyanda

00:22:10.162 --> 00:22:14.199
a misty rain made a screen of water.
Kosame ga tsukutta mizu no sukuriin ga

00:22:14.199 --> 00:22:16.768
Until that time when it dries,
Kawaku sono toki made

00:22:16.768 --> 00:22:19.794
it is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:19.971 --> 00:22:23.442
More than small coincidences like that,
Sonna chiisana guuzen yori mo

00:22:23.442 --> 00:22:26.845
the fact that you are there...
Kimi ga soko ni iru koto ga

00:22:26.845 --> 00:22:30.349
...cannot be a small thing, I think.
Chiisai hazu ga nai to omounda

00:22:30.349 --> 00:22:33.978
Even though it's obvious.
Atarimae nandakedo

00:22:35.654 --> 00:22:42.427
It must be sad not to have anyone.
Daremo inai to kanashii koto deshou

00:22:42.427 --> 00:22:49.368
Now, come on out to where the sun is shining.
Saa hi no ataru basho e dete-oide

00:22:49.368 --> 00:22:56.208
Even the several incidents that trouble you...
Kimi o komaraseru ikutsuka no dekigoto mo

00:22:56.208 --> 00:23:01.168
...are coincidences of yesterdays past.
Kinou izen no guuzen nanda yo

00:23:03.048 --> 00:23:08.384
Though, I'm sure you actually know that already.
Hontou wa wakatteru to omou kedo

00:23:15.127 --> 00:23:16.856
Preview

00:23:17.062 --> 00:23:18.324
Technos Taboo.

00:23:18.864 --> 00:23:20.766
That which took the old man's life...

00:23:20.766 --> 00:23:23.468
...and now had crushed Joey's dream...

00:23:23.468 --> 00:23:25.527
...was a law imposed by The Third.

00:23:26.338 --> 00:23:27.134
Why?

00:23:27.739 --> 00:23:29.708
In order to find the answer to that question,

00:23:29.708 --> 00:23:31.767
I decided to go to the Steel Gorge.

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:36.212
Even if that meant picking
a fight with The Third...

00:23:37.149 --> 00:23:40.685
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.685 --> 00:23:42.020
episode 23, "To the Steel Gorge".

00:23:42.020 --> 00:23:43.422
To the Steel Gorge
episode 23, "To the Steel Gorge".

00:23:43.422 --> 00:23:44.889
To the Steel Gorge
